WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome to HUMAN!

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.600
Now, yes I know! I-I don't have my beard back yet!

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.360
That's not something that I can control!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.420
I don't grow facial hair very quickly

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.900
SO LET'S JUST MOVE ON AND DEAL WITH A FEW

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.540
VIDEOS from the prepubescent larval stage of Markiplier

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.220
and move on with our lives!

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.160
ANYWAY!

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.320
This game is called HUMAN

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:24.180
And apparently, (GAME TEXT): The following footage was captured during an attempt

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.000
to hack and record a government video stream.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.880
Previously captured footage suggests the man filming, "Paul"

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.340
works for a secret sector of frequency testing facility, located deep in the Alaskan Wilderness.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:38.440
The program is no longer being funded, thus Paul is sent to notify the employees,

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.520
and have them leave the premises as the supervisors monitor what unfolds

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.580
once he arrives.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.940
I've taken the liberty of subtitling the video,

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.380
But other than that this footage is completely untouched. (text reads: undoctored)

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.560
So as you can see, we're kind of in a "deep web" area of the game,

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:55.300
As you can see by these lovely not quite working tabs up there. [We can't see them Mark.]

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.840
But this, is a horror game as you may have guessed

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:01.020
GAME: Can you hear me, Paul? Alright, listen, I want you to get inside, find the workers,

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.400
and notify them of our funding issue.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.820
If they ask any questions, we'll get their equipment moved out later,

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.300
just get them out of there for now.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:12.120
Then I want you to go to the back, find the antennas, and turn off the power supply.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:16.040
This is very important, do not forget this before you leave.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.140
MARK: Wait, I gotta go back and find the antennas and turn off the power supply?

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:20.860
WHY AND HOW?!

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.440
